            new RailwayWisdomRule("PNT-005", "Points", "Point Machine", "Diagnostic", "Normative", "Normal and reverse current should be approximately similar", "A material direction difference or increase from baseline points to asymmetric load, packing, rubbing, tongue lift, lubrication, dirt, or electrical termination issues.", "Compare complete waveforms, time, voltage, weather, maintenance, both ends, and direction-specific baseline.", "Do not compare partial waveform or different movement types as identical operations.", "IRSEM-2021", "19.3.2", "392-393", "point current normal reverse high friction packing rubbing lubrication", 94, ""),
